==Battleground==
*1 [[Package Doge]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is extremely easy. The boss, Package Doge, is extremely weak, dealing very little damage and not moving whatsoever, despite being a dreaded Metal-type enemy. Just send out fast attackers like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow]] to quickly kill it. The base will fall just as quickly.

For an even faster clear, just use an AoE Long Distance unit like [[Vengeful Cat (Rare Cat)|Kite]] who will attack the boss but end up hitting the base, winning the level very quickly.

But the best way to clear this stage, is sending some critical hitter units, because, as previously mentioned, the boss is a Metal enemy.

